+<!-- MACHINE-DRAFT:design-approach:4fa550e9aac26c5f5a3c89b853d9af0ad0749943358808fbc1196064a42c1173:begin 机器预填段——整段改写会被 flow done 拒收；确要修改：sillyspec flow amend-draft --change 2026-09-27-gate-docs-cleanup 留痕重锚 -->
